- (r) the  importation  for  the  purpose  of  distribution  or making available of copies of any work  in  an  accessible format copy by an authorized entity, the person with print disability himself or any other person  acting  on  his  behalf including his caregiver, and on such terms as the Minister may  determine;  and
- (s) the  exportation  for  the  purpose  of  distribution  or making available of copies of any work in an accessible format copy by  an  authorized  entity  to  a  member  of   the Marrakesh Treaty and  on such terms as the Minister may determine.
